==================================================================
 2. A monorepo PR touching only scripts/ concludes clean, not an
    unproven rollout of services it never touched
==================================================================
$ fm-change-watch.sh register ms-91 <PR URL>
change-watch: registered ms-91-91 for https://github.com/Muso-AI/muso-messaging/pull/91 (1 target(s); the change deploys nothing: no Deployment path is touched by the diff); beta: beta clean: nothing to measure: no changed path is served by a beta target (web-credits-next -> muso-dev/credits-gate)

cluster targets recorded: (none - the watch did not threaten the notification services)

==================================================================
 3. A genuine rollout failure is still reported as a regression
==================================================================
$ fm-change-watch.sh verdict fd-8    # after the failing rollout
change-watch regressed at +5m on http_5xx_per_min (40.0000 vs baseline 0.1667)

operator notification sent:
  fd change-watch https://github.com/Muso-AI/demo-service/pull/8 regressed at +5m on http_5xx_per_min (target muso-prod/demo, measured 40.0000, baseline 0.1667); investigate before the next sample
